 gaps:[["Cordless power tool platforms","The battery platform is the modern moat in tools and India has no entrant at that level. Cheston and iBELL assemble around imported cells, motors and controllers","open"],["Brushless tool motors and electronics","Atomberg built proprietary BLDC motor and field-oriented-control drive technology for fans and took it into HVAC compressors in 2026. Power tools are an adjacent application it has not entered","open"],["Digital jobsite and laser measurement","Bosch, Leica and Topcon hold laser levels and site layout instruments. Indian firms distribute rather than manufacture","open"]],
