 gaps:[["Cordless tool platforms","Milwaukee and DEWALT hold the professional platforms and Ryobi the consumer tier. India has no entrant at platform level, and Cheston and iBELL assemble around imported packs, motors and controllers","open"],["Brand consolidation as a barrier","Milwaukee, Ryobi, AEG, Ridgid power tools and Hart sit under one Hong Kong owner. An Indian entrant faces a single competitor wearing several badges across every price tier","open"]],
