 gaps:[["Engineered construction anchors","Hilti, ITW and fischer hold certified structural anchoring. India builds at enormous scale and imports the anchors that hold it together, with no domestic manufacture at certified class","open"],["Materials testing machines","Instron, ZwickRoell and MTS hold universal testing. Every Indian materials qualification runs on an imported machine; Star Testing Systems operates well below that class","open"],["Robotic welding cells","Difacto and Systemantics integrate imported cells. The welding robot and the process control above it are foreign","open"]],
